| `scripts/jobs/build_corpus.py` | Walks the repository into `wiki/corpus.json`, the one index agents query; `scripts/jobs/check_corpus.py` imports it to prove a fresh build is valid and reproducible. | `make site-data` | — | Builds the corpus; it does not judge it: `scripts/jobs/check_corpus.py` does. Escaping writes exit 2; mutations use the confined resolved path. | [deterministic-checks.md](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
